'''Sea Serpent Daliasan''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]] increases health, Savage Blow chance and speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

